'''KOI''' (also known as '''Movistar KOI''' for sponsorship purposes) is a [[:Category:Spain|Spanish]] esports organization founded by [[leagueoflegends:Ibai|Ibai]] and [[wikipedia:Gerard_Piqué|Gerard Piqué]] in December 2021. In January 2024 [[wikipedia:OverActive_Media|OverActive Media]] announced the acquisition of  '''[[KOI]]''' and '''Movistar Riders''', merging it with '''MAD Lions''' to form a single organization.

